/* Help */
"Help" = "Bantuan";
"Tap a card to pick it. Tap it again to put it back." = "Ketuk kartu untuk memilih. Ketuk lagi untuk batal.";
"Double-tap takes the pair or three of that rank, or the whole suit when you hold five or more of it." = "Ketuk dua kali untuk pasangan atau tiga kartu seangka, atau satu jenis bila Anda pegang lima atau lebih.";
"Hold a card to take every card of that rank." = "Tahan kartu untuk mengambil semua kartu seangka.";
"Lead and Play send the cards you picked. Pass stays out. You cannot pass a lead. The empty box clears the pick." = "Turun mengirim kartu yang dipilih. Pas tidak ikut. Turun pertama tidak bisa dipas. Kotak kosong membatalkan pilihan.";
"The sort button shows ♠ or 2: that is the order a tap switches to." = "Tombol urut menampilkan ♠ atau 2: itu urutan setelah diketuk.";
"The player with the 3♦ leads the first deal. Match the play on the table with a higher one, or pass." = "Pemain yang pegang 3♦ turun duluan di ronde pertama. Kalahkan kartu di meja, atau pas.";
"Two or three of a kind: higher rank wins, then the highest suit among them." = "Dua atau tiga kartu: angka lebih besar menang, lalu jenis tertinggi di antaranya.";
"Five cards, from low to high: straight, flush, full house, four of a kind, straight flush." = "Lima kartu, dari kecil ke besar: straight, flush, full house, empat seangka, straight flush.";
"A straight runs A2345, then 23456, up to TJQKA. JQKA2 is not a straight." = "Straight dari A2345, lalu 23456, sampai TJQKA. JQKA2 bukan straight.";
"A straight is ranked by its highest card, then that card's suit. In A2345 the high card is the 5." = "Straight dibanding kartu tertingginya, lalu jenis kartu itu. Di A2345 kartu tinggi adalah 5.";
"A flush is ranked by its highest card, then that card's suit. A full house by the three of a kind. Four of a kind by the four." = "Flush dibanding kartu tertinggi, lalu jenisnya. Full house dibanding tiga seangkanya. Empat seangka dibanding keempatnya.";
"Each card left costs its rank: 3 is 1, up to 2 which is 13. Ten or more cards left doubles the cost. The winner takes all three totals." = "Setiap kartu sisa dihitung angkanya: 3 bernilai 1, sampai 2 bernilai 13. Sepuluh kartu atau lebih digandakan. Pemenang mengambil ketiga jumlah itu.";
"A game is ten deals." = "Satu permainan sepuluh ronde.";
"With Hong Kong rules, from the next deal: the last winner leads, and 23456 is the highest straight." = "Aturan Hong Kong, mulai ronde berikut: pemenang tadi turun duluan, dan 23456 adalah straight terbesar.";
"Enter your name. The dark row is you. Leave a row blank to keep its name." = "Masukkan nama Anda. Baris gelap adalah Anda. Baris kosong mempertahankan namanya.";
